Pokémon Trainer.{VAR BE01}
The sparkle in your eyes...
I feel your kindness toward Pokémon!{VAR BE01}
I have decided! I will entrust the Egg
I found in the Relic Castle to you!{VAR BE01}
Would you like to receive this
Pokémon Egg and raise it?

I appreciate your thought, but you
cannot take the Egg right now because{VAR BE00}
your party is full.

Pokémon Eggs hatch when you carry them
with you. Being around healthy Pokémon{VAR BE00}
helps them grow!

Wait! Wait!{VAR BE01}
Aren't your Pokémon a bit tired?
Here, don't be shy! Let them rest!{VAR BE01}
